Package: lavaanrust
Type: Package
Title: Rust Backends for the GenomicSEM lavaan Compatibility Experiment
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Andrew", "Ho", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ajh@example.com")
Author: Andrew Ho
Maintainer: Andrew Ho <ajh@example.com>
Description: Experimental Rust-backed implementations of the narrow lavaan
    surface used by GenomicSEM. This package is intentionally incomplete and is
    meant to support side-by-side backend experiments, not to act as a general
    replacement for lavaan.
